WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.790
- What's been your favorite part

00:00:01.790 --> 00:00:03.290
of making movies so far?

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:06.640
I imagine you are so fun
to work with, by the way.

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:08.940
- I liked to have fun for sure.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:12.850
I like, you know, for sure
you gotta take work seriously

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:14.490
but I like to have fun while doing it.

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:16.890
So for sure, try and be

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:18.450
keep the jokes going and everything.

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:21.160
But I would say like my favorite things

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.640
about being in, working
on movies and stuff

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:25.870
so far is, I mean, two
things come to mind.

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:29.570
Is like the really dope people you meet

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:32.520
along the way that are like so different

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:34.660
that you didn't think you would have

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:36.200
crossed paths with before.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.280
Super rad meeting new people.

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.700
And secondly, like right out of the oven,

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:43.699
fresh-baked chocolate chip cookies.

00:00:43.699 --> 00:00:45.560
(laughing)

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:48.423
- Somehow I knew you were
headed towards munchies.

00:00:49.990 --> 00:00:52.577
- Honestly, they're so good.

00:00:52.577 --> 00:00:54.349
They're so good.

00:00:54.349 --> 00:00:57.923
Catering is so dank on movies, I swear.

